<?php declare(strict_types=1);?><!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Privacy information — TG Gateways</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/style.css"></head><body><header class="container topnav"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/assets/img/logo.svg" alt="">TG Gateways</a><a href="/docs.php">Developer docs</a></header><main class="container" style="max-width:800px;padding:55px 0"><div class="eyebrow">PRIVACY INFORMATION</div><h1>Know what this starter stores.</h1><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9">TG Gateways is a software starter intended to be self-hosted by a merchant or operator. The deploying operator is responsible for publishing a privacy notice, defining retention and access policies, and meeting applicable legal obligations. This page is general technical information, not a legal notice or compliance certification.</p><div class="card"><h3>Data represented in the included schema</h3><ul style="font-size:12px;color:#66738a;line-height:2"><li>Merchant account email, name and password hash.</li><li>Optional customer name, email and phone entered for an order.</li><li>Order amount, status, UTR/reference and sender name parsed from a receipt.</li><li>Merchant UPI ID, receipt mailbox address, and an encrypted mailbox app password.</li><li>Webhook destinations and delivery status/payloads.</li></ul><p style="font-size:11px;color:#66738a;line-height:1.8">Use only fields necessary for your flow. The app does not intentionally store bank login credentials, but the configured mailbox app password grants mailbox access. An IMAP parser necessarily inspects receipt email content in memory; the operator must secure the mailbox and server and set appropriate retention.</p></div><div class="card panel"><h3>Operational safeguards</h3><p style="font-size:12px;color:#66738a;line-height:1.9">Use TLS, a dedicated mailbox, encryption-key protection, restricted database access, backups, deletion procedures and audit logs that do not contain credentials or message bodies. No assertion is made that this software complies with any specific privacy statute. Obtain qualified advice for your deployment.</p></div></main></body></html>
